# Build context is the package directory; only profiles/reviewer-ci,
# presets/maestro-reviewer, presets/maestro-auditor, and docker/ are
# actually COPYed (see docker/Dockerfile's COPY lines). Allowlist rather
# than denylist: a denylist needs updating every time something new is
# added to the package (it previously missed src/, client/, templates/,
# .github/, .claude/, presets/maestro-coder/, and the locally-growing
# .maestro-history/ scratch dir from local testing) and silently ships
# whatever it forgets.
*
!profiles/reviewer-ci
!presets/maestro-reviewer
!presets/maestro-auditor
!docker
# Never ship a local dev install — the Dockerfile installs its own inside
# the build (pnpm --dir profiles/reviewer-ci install --frozen-lockfile).
profiles/reviewer-ci/node_modules
